{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock full face tracking on your avatars with VRCFT (VRChat Face Tracking)--a powerful, modular desktop application that unleashes face-tracking support from multiple VR headsets and trackers. Simply install VRCFT, choose the module(s) that apply to your hardware, and use a Unified Expression enabled avatar in VRChat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Integrates seamlessly with VRChat using OSC</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introduced the Unified Expression standard (142 supported blendshapes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Works with a wide variety of free, paid, and custom avatars </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Works with the Quest Pro, Vive Pro Eye, Vive Facial Tracker, and other popular hardware</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy setup and light footprint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VRCFT is the go-to standard for adding face tracking to VRChat.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3329480?t=1743696257","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3329480?t=1743696257","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329480/ac6a31952f0d136c8da15a3c723eba5ab3d895cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743696257","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329480/ac6a31952f0d136c8da15a3c723eba5ab3d895cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743696257","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock full face tracking on your avatars with VRCFT (VRChat Face Tracking)--a powerful, modular desktop application that unleashes face-tracking support from multiple VR headsets and trackers. Simply install VRCFT, choose the module(s) that apply to your hardware, and use a Unified Expression enabled avatar in VRChat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Integrates seamlessly with VRChat using OSC</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introduced the Unified Expression standard (142 supported blendshapes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Works with a wide variety of free, paid, and custom avatars </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Works with the Quest Pro, Vive Pro Eye, Vive Facial Tracker, and other popular hardware</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy setup and light footprint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VRCFT is the go-to standard for adding face tracking to VRChat.</p>","developers":["benaclejames"],"genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3329480/c374fd07ec9b8ee7e3a40c96a0af175483775e42/header.jpg?t=1743696257","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257113019,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113019/movie480.mp4?t=1743696256","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113019/movie_max.mp4?t=1743696256"},"name":"Main","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257113019/5b7f4648c0ee47e6862ccfd0c26112481634ccc2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743696256","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113019/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743696256","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113019/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743696256"}}],"name":"VRCFaceTracking","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["benaclejames"],"ratings":null,"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"